[style name="Interaction_Style"]
if {Whiskers.Forest_Interaction_phase} == 1:
	join Thorinn leftmost
	join Whiskers rightmost
	if {Whiskers.New_Dialog} == true:
		set {Whiskers.New_Dialog} = false
		Thorinn: Hey kitty, what are you doing all the way out here?
		Whiskers: **shivering** Me-me-meow
		Thorinn: Looks like you’re really cold.
		Thorinn: It is starting to get dark. I’ll make a campfire to warm you up.
		set {Whiskers.New_Dialog} = false
	else:
		Whiskers: **shivers**
		Thorinn: I should hurry up and get this campfire going.
elif {Whiskers.Forest_Interaction_phase} == 2:
	join Thorinn leftmost
	join Whiskers rightmost
	if {Whiskers.New_Dialog} == true:
		Thorinn: Look at you! For such a small animal you have really big Whiskers!
		Thorinn: Hmm I like that! I think I will call you Whisker.
		Thorinn: You know what's funny?
		Thorinn: Even though I just met you, I feel like I’ve known you forever.
		Whiskers: I know, right!
		Thorinn: AAAAAAAAAAH!
		Thorinn: You can talk? I think I am hallucinating!
		Whiskers: No Thorinn, you're not! Don’t be scared.
		Whiskers: I can only communicate with you, you are the only one that will understand me when I talk. But I am not able to reveal why. At least not now...
		Whiskers: Don’t worry, I will be your friend, I will keep you company on this journey.
		Thorinn: Are you feeling better, now that you’re warmed up? And how do you know my name?
		Whiskers: Thanks for asking. I’m not cold anymore, but I’m a little hungry. Can you find me some food and cook it over the fire?
		- Yes, search for some fish.
			Whiskers: There should be a river up ahead. See if you can catch a fish for us there.
			[signal arg="start_fish_quest"]
			set {Whiskers.New_Dialog} = false
		- No, ignore Whiskers.
			leave Whiskers
			[signal arg="hugo_encounter"]
		- No, you try to scare Whiskers away.
			Whiskers: Fine I'll go and find my own food.
			leave Whiskers
			[signal arg="cat_leaves"]
			[signal arg="hugo_encounter"]
	else:
		Whiskers: There should be a river up ahead. See if you can catch a fish for us there.
elif {Whiskers.Forest_Interaction_phase} == 3:
	join Thorinn leftmost
	Hey!
	[signal arg="thorinn_looks_right"]
	Thorinn: !!!
	[wait time="3.0"]
	join Hugo rightmost
	Hugo: What are you doing here traveler?
	Thorinn: I'm trying to find my way to a small village called Rockfall. But I've lost my way as soon as it got darker. What about you? Why are you here and who are you?
	Hugo: I’m Hugo. I saw your campfire while collecting my ingredients for supper at my inn.
	Hugo: I’ve lived in Rockfall my whole life, so I know this forest by heart.
	Hugo: Can I help you get there? The village is not that far anymore.
	- Yes
		Hugo: Then come along traveller, you must be tired from your journey.
		Hugo: I'll show you to my inn.
		[signal arg="follow_hugo"]
	- No
		Hugo: You will have your reasons. Then I'll be on my way.
		Hugo: You're welcome to stay at my inn once you arrive.
		[signal arg="leave_hugo"]
		leave Hugo
		[wait time="4.0"]
